http://www.lojban.org/cgi-bin/mail_search.pl is a *very*
literalistic search engine that goes through all archived e-mail.
It is for BPFK use only, if at all possible; it is very CPU
expensive.

If it's not doing what you expect, it may be because it's searching
HTML versions of the e-mails; let me know what you're trying to do
and I should be able to help.

